<title>USA: Thrustmaster Q4 shr $0.31 vs $0.09.</title>
<headline>Thrustmaster Q4 shr $0.31 vs $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dollars in thousands (Unaudited)  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>					     December 31,  December 31,</p>
<p>					    1996   1995    1996    1995</p>
<p> Revenues			     $15,07 $6,404 $30,821 $19,415</p>
