<p>					   4,561  4,427   4,512   4,168</p>
<p>On January 21, 1997,  the Board of Directors of ThrustMaster, Inc. declared a 3% stock dividend payable to shareholders of record on February 14, 1997.  The adjusted pro forma earnings per share for the quarters ended December 31, 1996 and 1995 were $0.30 and $0.09 respectively.  For the years ended December 31, 1996 and 1995, the adjusted pro forma earnings per share were $0.49  and $0.32  respectively.</p>
